      "dot": "cyan",
      "title": "One-way and once only",
      "items": [
        "MarkReversedBy throws if called twice; ReversePostingCommandHandler also refuses a row that is itself a reversal",
        "There is no path back to Posted: a mistake is corrected by a new posting, never by editing this one",
        "Reverse refuses POSTING_ALREADY_REVERSED, POSTING_IS_REVERSAL and account status violations before writing"
      ]
